WEBVTT

00:23:57.788 --> 00:24:01.663
the office when it premiered in the U.S.
and that you weren't even a fan of

00:24:01.663 --> 00:24:05.746
the entire first season. Is it true? And
what led you to rethink that view?

00:24:06.538 --> 00:24:09.746
I think that what I felt was
when I first watched it,

00:24:09.954 --> 00:24:13.038
because I became a huge fan, which
is why I reached out to them,

00:24:13.246 --> 00:24:15.621
essentially begging them to
hire me as a director.

00:24:17.246 --> 00:24:20.746
I was such a fan of the
original and in fact,

00:24:20.954 --> 00:24:25.913
to a degree that I reached out to Ricky
Gervais and wrote a part for him in Alias.

00:24:27.079 --> 00:24:32.704
And I was such a fan of that show and
the specificity of it that it felt.